  "description": "<p>Handmade dress shoes for men since 1954, we resell, dropship and sell our own products specializing in loafers and oxford shoes for men, women and children</p>\r\n<p>High ticket products with an average order value of $100. Apply now, we auto approve!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div>Since 1954 Ashour Shoes has been creating Leather Dress Shoes, comfort insoles, height insoles, shoe inserts, you name it! All using only the finest models, designs and materials that are hand crafted to perfection by the most skilled of labor, to produce outstanding footwear products that are suitable for everyday life and work occasions.</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 230, 230);\">.</span></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0512/7546/4889/files/black-and-white-photo-of-shoes-outside_480x480.jpg?v=1644278175\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"280\"></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>Recently Ashour shoes has introduced a new line of Italian style dress shoes which represents our highest quality shoes to be produced yet.</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">.</span></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><img style=\"margin-right: -68.1944px; float: none;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0512/7546/4889/files/w1500_q80_2048x2048.jpg?v=1605054954\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\"></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"dpx-aplus-product-description_feature_div\">\r\n<div id=\"aplus_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"27ju1z-3kbs6g-bbb77r-rwljlu\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus_feature_div\">\r\n<div id=\"aplus\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-large bucket\">\r\n<div class=\"aplus-v2 desktop celwidget\" data-csa-c-id=\"sf1sff-oqx8jb-kw6fon-hz9m07\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus\">\r\n<div class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-3 aplus-standard\" data-csa-c-id=\"frrtvi-wvfpje-1eysux-cdl9of\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-module-3\">\r\n<div class=\"a-expander-collapsed-height a-row a-expander-container a-expander-partial-collapse-container\" aria-live=\"polite\" data-a-expander-name=\"aplus-module-expander\" data-a-expander-collapsed-height=\"700\">\r\n<div class=\"a-expander-content a-expander-partial-collapse-content\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\r\n<div class=\"aplus-module-wrapper apm-floatnone apm-fixed-width\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule apm-spacing\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule-imageright\"><img class=\"a-spacing-mini\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/vc/0fed306d-8b98-494d-b33b-8b64dbf5d58f._CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300__.jpg\" alt=\"men dress shoes\" data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/vc/0fed306d-8b98-494d-b33b-8b64dbf5d58f._CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300__.jpg\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule-imageright\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule-imageright\">\r\n<h3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1em; line-height: 1.4;\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1em; line-height: 1.4;\">Stylish Design</h3>\r\n<p class=\"a-spacing-base\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; line-height: 1.4;\">Enhance your look with the streamlined silhouette of a classic oxford shoe. A versatile style with a no seam cap-toe oxford features hand painted Argentinean leather. The shoes is as comfortable in the boardroom as it is on the dancefloor.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule-textleft\">\r\n<h3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1em; line-height: 1.4;\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-6 aplus-standard\" data-csa-c-id=\"55tflu-mezpjp-3f7ixn-l2dtcg\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-module-6\">\r\n<div class=\"aplus-module-wrapper apm-fixed-width\">\r\n<div id=\"aplus-module-6-2\" class=\"aplus-module-content\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-hovermodule\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"apm-hovermodule-slides\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-hovermodule-image\"><img class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/vc/a7b92cde-3502-40dc-80bc-8b7a114e39a3._CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300__.jpg\" alt=\"men dress shoes\" data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/vc/a7b92cde-3502-40dc-80bc-8b7a114e39a3._CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300__.jpg\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"apm-hovermodule-slides-inner\">\r\n<h3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1em; line-height: 1.4;\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"apm-hovermodule-slidecontrol\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-hovermodule-smallimage celwidget\" data-csa-c-id=\"21tj04-ntrq7m-1x14d3-kz91ow\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-module-6-hover-1\">\r\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-mini apm-hovermodule-smallimage-bg\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"apm-hovermodule-smallimage celwidget apm-hovermodule-opacitymodon\" data-csa-c-id=\"25w5jj-s1ks5r-1lj1e8-jngr05\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-module-6-hover-4\">\r\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-mini apm-hovermodule-smallimage-bg\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; line-height: 1.4;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-9 aplus-standard\" data-csa-c-id=\"1qmk15-k8dk4c-p4w3ix-abfzpt\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-module-9\">\r\n<div class=\"a-expander-collapsed-height a-row a-expander-container a-expander-partial-collapse-container\" aria-live=\"polite\" data-a-expander-name=\"aplus-module-expander\" data-a-expander-collapsed-height=\"700\">\r\n<div class=\"a-expander-content a-expander-partial-collapse-content\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\r\n<div class=\"aplus-module-wrapper apm-fixed-width\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-spacing apm-fixed-width\">\r\n<h3 class=\"a-spacing-small\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1em; line-height: 1.4;\">Simplicity and Elegance&nbsp;</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Ashour Shoes wasn't created on a whim. It is the product of a lifetime of experience in the luxury footwear business and realizing that it&rsquo;s broken - men shouldn't have to spend obscene amounts for a handcrafted world-class shoe. So we set out to fix it.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"row row-mobile\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-6\"><img src=\"https://cdn.acemarks.com/media/wysiwyg/about-us/img-about-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-6\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.acemarks.com/media/wysiwyg/about-us/img-about-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">In late 2012 When we decoded to launch our revived 1954 signature line, we realized that men had three choices when it came to dress shoes. Buy cheap, poorly made shoes, spend a little more to get a pair with a slight cosmetic upgrade, or spend an uncomfortable amount on a pair from the luxury super powers. If you like to look good, these aren&rsquo;t good choices.</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"row row-mobile\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-6\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 mb28\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-6 col-xs-6\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-6 col-xs-6\" style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-6 col-xs-6\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-6 col-xs-6\" style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">harnessing modern technology, we knew that we could get rid of middlemen and their mark-ups to directly deliver a world-class, handcrafted shoe rivalling those of the top luxury brands, all at an attainable price.</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"row row-mobile mb28\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-6\"><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://cdn.acemarks.com/media/wysiwyg/about-us/img-about-8.jpg\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">After miles of travel and many hours touring factories, developing styles, and choosing materials, Ashour has imported the skills and the materials needed to create our perfect dress shoes in Jordan and now they are finally here.</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">.</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">In developing our unique combinations of colours and materials, it was vital to us that our shoes marks fulfils the needs of the modern gentleman. We created a reasonably priced, cleverly contemporary, utterly luxurious and comfortable dress shoe that makes a lavish powerful statement whether you&rsquo;re landing your first client or running a Fortune 500 company.</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">Weather you're looking for top quality shoes or insoles, Ashour shoes has got it all</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-bottom\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"last-text\">\r\n<h4 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1em; line-height: 1.4; text-align: center;\">When you receive your first pair of Ashour Shoes&nbsp;the quality and comfort will be clear to you.</h4>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; line-height: 1.4;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1em; line-height: 1.4; text-align: center;\">WE ARE ONE OF A KIND. JUST LIKE YOU.</h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; line-height: 1.4;\">&nbsp;The three rules of&nbsp;why would you need an&nbsp;elegant men's shoes:</p>\r\n<table class=\"apm-fixed-width apm-eventhirdcol-table\" style=\"width: 531.806px; border: 1px dashed rgb(204, 204, 204);\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th class=\"apm-center\" style=\"border: 1px dashed rgb(204, 204, 204);\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-eventhirdcol apm-floatleft\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; line-height: 1.4;\">&nbsp;1</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</th>\r\n<th class=\"apm-center\" style=\"border: 1px dashed rgb(204, 204, 204);\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-eventhirdcol apm-floatleft\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; line-height: 1.4;\">&nbsp;2</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</th>\r\n<th class=\"apm-center\" style=\"border: 1px dashed rgb(204, 204, 204);\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-eventhirdcol apm-floatleft\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; line-height: 1.4;\">3&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"apm-top\" style=\"border: 1px dashed rgb(204, 204, 204);\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-eventhirdcol apm-floatleft\">\r\n<p class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; line-height: 1.4;\">The classic and timeless oxford deserves a place in every man's closet.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"apm-top\" style=\"border: 1px dashed rgb(204, 204, 204);\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-eventhirdcol apm-floatleft\">\r\n<p class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; line-height: 1.4;\">The right pair of oxford shoes can turn you into a man of fashion in the blink of an eye.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"apm-top\" style=\"border: 1px dashed rgb(204, 204, 204);\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-eventhirdcol apm-floatleft\">\r\n<p class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1em; line-height: 1.4;\">Enhance your look with the streamlined silhouette of a classic oxford shoes It's as comfortable in the boardroom as it is on the dancefloor.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>",
